      "reason": "Clarify the objective and sampler implementation before attributing improvements to stronger ranking competition.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation SASRec sampled softmax versus generalized binary cross entropy gSASRec: how do uniform negatives sampled without replacement, user-history exclusions, variable candidate counts, and accidental hits affect sampling correction and comparison with BCE?"
