      "reason": "Find appropriate controls for the proposed residual and assess when recent interactions provide misleading evidence.",
      "query": "SASRec gated recent-item mean pooling residual ablation normalization embedding scale: how do sequential recommendation studies distinguish recency gains from LayerNorm changes, repeated-item shortcuts, and durable-goods purchase saturation, using only interaction histories and timestamps?"
